nerations of Adam. In the day that God created man, He made him in His own likeness.","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":6,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"This is the account of Noah. Noah was a righteous man, blameless in his generation; Noah walked with God.","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":9,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And God blessed Noah and his sons and said to them, “Be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth.","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":9,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But as for you, be fruitful and multiply; spread out across the earth and multiply upon it.”","from":1}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"6-20":{"people":[{"id":"cush-h3568g","name":"Cush","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ham","count":3,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"canaan-h3667g","name":"Canaan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ham","count":2,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"egypt-h4714h","name":"Egypt","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ham","count":2,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"ham-h2526g","name":"Ham","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Noah","count":2,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"put-h6316g","name":"Put","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ham","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"dedan-h1719b","name":"Dedan","kind":"person","brief":"A Cushite","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"havilah-h2341h","name":"Havilah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"raamah-h7484g","name":"Raamah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"sabtah-h5454","name":"Sabtah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"sabteca-h5455","name":"Sabteca","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"seba-h5434g","name":"Seba","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"sheba-h7614g","name":"Sheba","kind":"person","brief":"A Cushite","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"nimrod-h5248","name":"Nimrod","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Cush","count":2,"firstVe