"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"There was a man in the land of Uz whose name was Job. And this man was blameless and upright, fearing God and shunning evil.","from":23},{"book":"LUK","chapter":3,"verse":35,"verseEnd":35,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"the son of Serug, the son of Reu, the son of Peleg, the son of Eber, the son of Shelah,","from":25},{"book":"LUK","chapter":3,"verse":36,"verseEnd":36,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"the son of Cainan, the son of Arphaxad, the son of Shem, the son of Noah, the son of Lamech,","from":25},{"book":"ACT","chapter":17,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"From one man He made every nation of men, that they should inhabit the whole earth; and He determined their appointed times and the boundaries of their lands.","from":25},{"book":"ACT","chapter":17,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"From one man He made every nation of men, that they should inhabit the whole earth; and He determined their appointed times and the boundaries of their lands.","from":32}],"notes":[],"groups":[]}}